    "description": "Finishing my CS degree at Federico II, after a year of backend work at IdeaSolutions and the Apple Developer Academy. Right now I'm the sole engineer and co-founder at Clinequal — a startup where I translate domain theory from my PhD co-founders into software that flags bias in clinical trials.\nBuilding alone has forced me to make every architectural decision myself: what to build, what to cut, how to keep things simple enough to actually ship. I like that pressure, but I also want to work alongside people who are better than me.\nOutside of code, I'm a photographer, a Tango dancer, and a Jazz/Prog-Rock lover. Based in Naples, Italy."
  },
